# Polaris Key pre-commit gate (husky v9).
# Kept deliberately lightweight: only the fast-failing, cheap guards that catch the
# most common "broke the contract" mistakes locally before a commit lands. The full
# six-language matrix (Python/Swift/Godot suites, admin build, format) runs in CI, not here.
#
#   1. cheap generators — `pnpm gen --fast --check` runs the registry families marked `fast` in
#      tools/generators.ts: the signed corpus must regenerate in place (no wire drift), every
#      language's service constants match tools/services.json, and the generators page is current.
#   2. typecheck         — every TS package still type-checks.
#
# Escape hatch: `git commit --no-verify` skips this for trivial/docs-only commits.

pnpm gen --fast --check
pnpm typecheck
